shairport_mqtt_topic.description:
The topic this receiver publishes to on the MQTT broker set in the AirPlay provider settings. Leave it empty to take it from the receiver's autodiscovery messages. It must match mqtt.topic in the receiver's shairport-sync configuration, which needs these settings:

mqtt = {
  enabled = "yes";
  hostname = "<broker>";
  topic = "<a topic unique to this receiver>";
  publish_raw = "yes";
  publish_parsed = "yes";
  enable_autodiscovery = "yes";
  enable_remote = "yes";
};
metadata = {
  include_cover_art = "yes";
};

Add the broker port, username and password too if your broker needs them.
